trait-alcohol-dependency-name = Alcohol dependency
trait-alcohol-dependency-desc = You need to drink alcohol at least once every 10 minutes, or you will get sick.
trait-narcotic-dependency-name = Narcotic dependency
trait-narcotic-dependency-desc = You need to take narcotics or stimulants at least once every 10 minutes, or you will get sick.
trait-ardon-dependency-name = Ardon dependency
trait-ardon-dependency-desc = You need to take ardon at least once every 10 minutes, or you will get sick.

dependency-alcohol-relief = The drink brings a welcome relief.
dependency-alcohol-craving-1 = You are desperate for a drink...
dependency-alcohol-craving-2 = Your mouth is dry. A few sips of something strong would be great.
dependency-alcohol-craving-3 = Your hands are begging for a bottle.
dependency-alcohol-craving-4 = You urgently need a drink.
dependency-alcohol-stage-1 = Without alcohol your legs feel weak.
dependency-alcohol-stage-2 = Your thoughts are tangled and everything around you swims.
dependency-alcohol-stage-3 = Your hands are shaking, and aiming gets harder.
dependency-alcohol-stage-4 = You are sick to your stomach, and your consciousness keeps slipping away.
dependency-alcohol-stage-5 = Your body is poisoned and failing without alcohol.

dependency-narcotic-relief = The withdrawal fades and you feel better.
dependency-narcotic-craving-1 = You really want a dose...
dependency-narcotic-craving-2 = You need something to take the edge off.
dependency-narcotic-craving-3 = You can only think about another dose.
dependency-narcotic-craving-4 = Your body demands another dose.
dependency-narcotic-stage-1 = Your hands start to shake, and aiming gets harder.
dependency-narcotic-stage-2 = Your head clouds over.
dependency-narcotic-stage-3 = You are trembling like in a fever.
dependency-narcotic-stage-4 = The withdrawal turns your stomach and poisons your body.

dependency-ardon-relief = Ardon dulls the pain, and you feel better.
dependency-ardon-craving-1 = You miss the ardon...
dependency-ardon-craving-2 = You want to feel the ardon again.
dependency-ardon-craving-3 = You can't think of anything but ardon.
dependency-ardon-craving-4 = Your body calls for ardon.
dependency-ardon-stage-1 = Your hands start to shake, and aiming gets harder.
dependency-ardon-stage-2 = Your head clouds over.
dependency-ardon-stage-3 = You are trembling like in a fever.
dependency-ardon-stage-4 = The withdrawal turns your stomach, and the cells of your body are breaking down.
